  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-06T17:01:13.744Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At the moment the “Colliders” section in the Avatar Descriptor can be a bit confusing. It’s titled Colliders, even though most of it is for Avatar Contacts. So maybe change it from “Colliders” to “Contacts & Colliders”.\nMy other suggestion would be to allow us to decide what each Collider / Contact is used for. At the moment all of them are used for Avatar Contacts and only the hand and fingers are used for Phys Bones Colliders. A lot of FBT users also put colliders on their feet, but not everyone needs or wants this. So why not let us decide what each Contact / Collider is used for? My suggestion for this would be to just add a selection menu for every option.\nThis would also make it easier for people to understand what every option is used for, since at the moment without reading the documentation, you don’t know that only the hands and fingers are also used for Phys Bones.\nThis is how I could imagine the selection to look like:",
